.SS " str bs4\&.element\&.CharsetMetaAttributeValue\&.substitute_encoding ( self, _Encoding  eventual_encoding = \fC'utf\-8'\fP)"

.PP
.nf
When an HTML document is being encoded to a given encoding, the
value of a ``<meta>`` tag's ``charset`` becomes the name of
the encoding\&.

.fi
